- **B4 (already measured), answering the two questions on the card:**
  - **(a) Moving a SubVI into a frame of a new Case inside a While body.** The only earlier measurement is cycles 97/98, which used a different tool (`move_into_frame`) and ended with ExecState going from 1 to 0, 8 + 1 wires with no terminals and 7 loose-end items, cleared only by Remove Bad Wires (`d1-loop12-17-split-plan.md:1504-1509,1531-1534`). No `stagekit.move_in` into a case frame has ever been measured. The scratch run's E1 checks at ops 10–12 are therefore the first such measurement, not a repeat.
