    - The tool currently refuses this shape. Its one-wire-in / one-wire-out rule at `tools/stagexec.py:857-859` is the refusal PD379(b) cites (`ring-p5.md:190`).

    This is the K3/K4 GAP, and it is **outside step 1**, so it does not affect this card.

